From: OpenAI audit
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: harden MT7530 Generic Netlink lifecycle and access validation

Register the Generic Netlink family before publishing its private device pointer,
serialize registration and teardown, reject concurrent second instances rather
than replacing a live pointer, unregister before releasing MT7530 resources,
validate PHY/DEVAD/register ranges, and propagate malformed-input and PHY-write
errors to userspace. Keep the Netlink ABI's u32 register/value attributes typed
as unsigned values.

